    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Tourism serves as the backbone of Goa's economy, driving tertiary sector employment and growth.",
        "Mormugao Port is the premier maritime gateway of Goa, facilitating key export and import trades.",
        "Mining, particularly of iron ore, represents a major historical component of Goa's industrial sector.",
        "Agriculture and paddy cultivation remain foundational to rural Goa despite structural shifts toward services."
